 "response": {
  "text": "Haan 😊 Agar **shaadi ke liye budget mein** saree chahiye, toh main ₹500–₹3,000 ke range mein ye options prefer karungi:\n\n### [MIMOSA Red Chiffon Banarasi Saree]()\n*₹1,499*\n\n### [Banarasi Georgette Saree]()\n*₹1,000*\n\n### [Organza Tissue Fancy Saree]()\n*₹2,350*\n\n### [Koskii Rani Pink Tissue Gold Saree]()\n*₹1,794*\n\n### [SWORNOF Banarasi Silk Saree]()\n*₹1,199*\n\n### [Koskii Rani Pink Soft Raw Silk Gold Saree]()\n*₹1,494*\n\n### 💃 Shaadi ke functions ke hisaab se\n\n- **Haldi/Mehendi:** bright yellow, green, pink **georgette/chiffon** — ₹800–₹1,500 mein achhe options mil rahe hain.\n- **Sangeet:** **organza/tissue** with embroidery — ₹1,500–₹2,500. Thoda modern aur classy look.\n- **Wedding:** **Banarasi silk/soft silk** — ₹1,200–₹3,000. Red, rani pink, wine ya bottle green bahut rich lagenge.\n- **Reception:** **Banarasi georgette/chiffon** ya tissue — lightweight bhi aur festive bhi.\n\nCurrent online listings mein ₹2,000–₹3,000 ke andar Banarasi, tissue, georgette aur semi-organza options kaafi mil rahe hain. [www.karagiri.com](https://www.karagiri.com/collections/saree-under-2999?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**Meri top budget pick:** ₹1,500–₹2,500 ki **Banarasi georgette/tissue saree + achha blouse + jhumke**. Saree ₹500 ki lene ke bajay blouse aur accessories par thoda invest karoge toh overall look kaafi expensive lagega.\n\nAgar tum **apna budget (₹1000 / ₹1500 / ₹2000 / ₹3000)** aur **age + skin tone + kis function ke liye saree chahiye** bata do, main tumhare liye 5–6 exact sarees shortlist kar dungi.",
